#: player.py
msgid "Space play or pause. Left and right arrows seek ten seconds. Up and down arrows change volume. Control plus left or right changes track. Control plus B adds a bookmark, control plus shift plus B adds a named bookmark, B opens the bookmark list. G goes to any position, such as 50 percent or 49 minutes. Control plus home starts from the beginning. Escape closes the player."
